    <title>Subconscious (Band)</title>
    <id>176067</id>
    <revision>
      <id>19563739</id>
      <timestamp>2005-07-25T09:28:14Z</timestamp>
      <contributor>
        <ip>202.83.166.194</ip>
      </contributor>
      <text xml:space="preserve">In February of 1999, '''Subconscious''' was formed in Berlin/Germany. 
While the band has presented itself rather old-school-dominated in its early days, the development during the last years eventually brought them closer to the modern and brutal Metalcore.
They 2002 released EP shown this way for the future and with the 2004 Release &quot;From The Ashes&quot; the band joins to be a part of the uprising German [[metalcore]] scene.It includes their most popular songs, the titletrack &quot;From The Ashes&quot; which is also released on a few compilations like the Circulation Records Sampler. The time for experimenting, as it was the case with “Arising”, is over. Now they’re more focused and technically versed

Especially on stage, Subconscious combine a dynamic and thrilling style.</text>
    </revision>
