      <comment>{{belgium-geo-stub}}</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Gr&amp;acirc;ce-Hollogne''' is a [[municipality]] located in the [[Belgium|Belgian]] province of [[Liege (province)|Li&amp;egrave;ge]]. On [[January 1]] [[2005]] Gr&amp;acirc;ce-Hollogne had a total population of 21,859. The total area is 34.24 [[square kilometre|km&amp;sup2;]] which gives a [[population density]] of 638.44 inhabitants per km&amp;sup2;.

