      <minor />
      <text xml:space="preserve">'''NLUUG''' (The Netherlands Unix User Group) is an association of professional [[Unix|UNIX]] users in the [[Netherlands]]. The group aims to increase and extend the awareness and use of UNIX and similar [[open system (computing)|open system]]s.

[[Bram Moolenaar]], the author of [[Vim (text editor)|Vim]] is a board member of NLUUG.

==External link==
*[http://www.nluug.nl/ NLUUG home page]


