        <id>656438</id>
      </contributor>
      <comment>hubertus</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Saint-Hubert''' may refer to:

* [[Hubertus|Saint-Hubert]], first [[Bishop of Liège|Prince-bishop of Liège]]. 
* [[Saint-Hubert, Belgium]], a municipality located in the Belgian province of Luxembourg;
* '''Saint-Hubert Le Roi''' is a district within the commune of [[Les Essarts-le-Roi]] in the Yvelines département of France;
* [[Saint-Hubert, Quebec]] was the name of a city located in the suburbs of [[Montreal]]. It is now part of [[Longueuil, Quebec]];
* [[Montréal/St-Hubert Airport|Saint-Hubert Airport]], an airport in [[Longueuil, Quebec]];
* [[St-Hubert]], a [[restaurant chain]] located in Eastern [[Canada]], mainly in [[Quebec]]. 

{{disambig}}

[[fr:Saint-Hubert]]
[[nl:Saint-Hubert]]</text>
