      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Peter Lehmann''' [http://www.peterlehmannwines.com/Default.aspx?p=3] (born [[1930]]) is an [[Australia]]n [[wine]] producer based in the [[Barossa Valley]]. Peter Lehmann Wines is located in the Barossa Valley, approximately 70 kilometres north of Adelaide in South Australia.

