  <page>
    <title>Rana</title>
    <id>176260</id>
    <revision>
      <id>40304823</id>
      <timestamp>2006-02-19T18:05:46Z</timestamp>
      <contributor>
        <username>Eugene van der Pijll</username>
        <id>22016</id>
      </contributor>
      <comment>adapted to MoS.</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Rana''' is:

* [[Rana, Norway]]
* [[Rana (genus)]], a genus of frogs
* [[Rana (clan)]], a clan in Jats in India
* The [[Rana dynasty]], an influential family in Nepal in the 19th and 20th century
* [[Rana Systems]], a defunct computer disk drive company
* [[Moon (Middle-earth)|Rána]], the moon, in Tolkien's Middle-earth.

'''Rana''' can also refer to:
* &quot;La Rana&quot; a nickname for artist [[Diego Rivera]], because of his purportedly frog-like appearance
* The name of a [[Jedi]] in Star Wars fiction
* An American rock and roll band from New Jersey.
* A Hindu language synonym for [[Raja]] or of royalty.
* A traditional name for the star [[Delta Eridani]]
* An [[Arabic language|Arabic]] name for a girl
* The name of a Hindu family originating from Gujarat in India.

{{disambig}}

[[fr:Rana]]
[[nl:Rana]]</text>
