*[http://www.slipstick.com Slipstick.com - A Popular Outlook and Exchange support site]
*[http://www.factplace.com/outlook.htm Microsoft Outlook at FactPlace]
*[http://www.mapilab.com MAPILab: 20+ add-ins for Microsoft Outlook 2000-2003]
*[http://www.pcreview.co.uk/forums/forum-276.php Microsoft Outlook Newsgroups]
*[http://robertpeloschek.blogspot.com/2005/11/importing-mozilla-thunderbird-mails-in.html Importing mails from Mozilla Thunderbird]
* [http://www.potolook.com Potolook - an extensive package of Outlook plug-ins]
* [http://www.add-in-express.com/add-in-net/ Add-in Express - Outlook COM add-in development on .NET]
* [http://www.skylook.biz Outlook Skype plugin to make phone calls to contacts]
*[http://www.recoveryengine.com/outlook-password/ Password Recovery Engine for Outlook] A tool to recover Outlook passwords, PST file passwords and Outlook mail passwords.
*[http://www.oemailrecovery.com Recovery Toolbox] [http://www.oemailrecovery.com/outlook-recovery.html Outlook Recovery Toolbox] Tool for recovering objects from a damaged or corrupted PST file. 
*[http://www.oemailrecovery.com Recovery Toolbox] [http://www.oemailrecovery.com/outlook_password_recovery.html Password Recovery Toolbox for Outlook] Tool for recovering passwords for e-mail accounts or PST files. 


