'''Nore og Uvdal''' is a municipality in the county of Buskerud, [[Norway]].

The municipality is located at the top of the valley Numedal, with a widely spread area of 2505 km&lt;sup&gt;2&lt;/sup&gt;. The civic centre is Rødberg.

==History==
[[Nore stave church]] (built around [[1166]] - [[1200]])


== External links ==
