      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Zenobi''' is probably the single company that have released most [[interactive fiction]], the total number is well over 150 adventures. The company was started by John Wilson (aka the Rochdale Balrog) in late [[1982]], first as a part-time job, but since early [[1986]] it became his full time job. The company was operational from [[1982]] to [[1997]], but John Wilson is still (2003) selling the &quot;Zenobi Adventures CD&quot; for £5 as well as selling out the old stock.

