* [http://adsabs.harvard.edu//full/seri/MNRAS/0053//0000184.000.html MNRAS '''53''' (1892) 184]
* [http://adsabs.harvard.edu//full/seri/Obs../0015//0000173.000.html Obs '''15''' (1892) 173]

