      <text xml:space="preserve">The '''Privy Council Office''' provides secretarial and administrative support to the [[Lord President of the Council]] in their capacity of president of [[Her Majesty]]'s Most Honourable Privy Council. The head of the Office is the [[Clerk of the Privy Council (United Kingdom)|Clerk of the Privy Council]].</text>
