* {{gutenberg|no=2527|name=The Sorrows of Young Werther}}
* [http://librivox.org/die-leiden-des-jungen-werthers-by-johann-wolfgang-von-goethe/ Free Audiobook (in German)] from [http://librivox.org LibriVox]
* [http://www.abacci.com/books/book.asp?bookID=2168 ''The Sorrows Of Young Werther'']
* [http://www.sbznet.de/?rubrik=kultur&amp;thema=02-03-14-01 &quot;Werther: Gefühle bleiben aktuell&quot;] (german article, [http://www.sbznet.de sbznet.de])
* [http://www.the-sorrows-of-young-werther.com The-Sorrows-of-Young-Werther.com ] (personalised e-mail edition sending Werther's letters to your mailbox)
* [[William Makepeace Thackeray]]'s ''[[Sorrows of Werther]]'' [http://www.cs.rice.edu/~ssiyer/minstrels/poems/183.html] 

