      <text xml:space="preserve">[[Image:Alpine Butterfly Bend Final.jpg|thumb|right|Alpine butterfly bend]]
[[Image:Alpine Butterfly Bend HowTo.jpg|thumb|right|Alpine butterfly bend step by step]]

The '''butterfly bend''' is a type of [[knot]].  It is the analogous bend form of the [[alpine butterfly knot]] in that it is the butterfly loop with the loop cut.

==External links==
* http://www.geocities.com/roo_two/butterflybend.html

