*{{cite journal|author=Ohta, T. and [[John H. Gillespie|Gillespie, J.H]] | year=1996 | title=Development of Neutral and Nearly Neutral Theories | journal=[[Theoretical Population Biology]] |volume=49 |pages=128-142}}
* {{cite journal | author=Sueoka, N. |year=1962 | title=On the genetic basis of variation and heterogeneity of DNA base composition|journal=[[Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences|PNAS USA]] |volume=48 | pages=582–592}} [http://www.pnas.org/cgi/reprint/48/4/582]

==External links==
