* '''The Nigger Factory'''. [[1972]] - ISBN 0862415276
* '''So Far, So Good'''. [[1990]] - ISBN 0883781336
* '''Now and Then: The Poems of Gil Scott-Heron'''. [[2001]] - ISBN 086241900X

==Samples==
*[[Media:SmallTalkat125thandLennox.ogg|Download sample]] &quot;Small Talk at 125th and Lenox&quot; from ''[[Small Talk at 125th and Lenox]]''

==External links==
