'''Jay Wiseman''' is a prominent [[BDSM]] writer, speaker and practitioner. His popular book, ''SM 101: A Realistic Introduction'', is considered to be one of the best introductory books on the subject. He is based in [[San Francisco, California]], was a EMT in the Oakland/East Bay Area.

He also wrote a well regarded introductory book on [[Bondage (BDSM)|bondage]] called ''Jay Wiseman's Erotic Bondage Handbook'' and other books dealing with the enhancement of sex life.

